    image: '/images/testimonial-chia.jpg',
  },
  {
    title: '“I Did My Own Due Diligence. Everything Checked Out.”',
    body: 'Finding an agent who is both professional and service-oriented is genuinely rare. I had viewed many decent projects, but no one could convince me with proper data — until the 222 Blueprint. Being who I am, I still ran my own due diligence afterwards. Every number and every claim matched exactly what was presented. That’s when I committed to this unit — a property my children will benefit from in the years ahead.',
